  "description": "End-user OIDC sign-in for the VisuAuth.EntraExternal adapter. Wraps Microsoft.Identity.Web so the consumer's /visuauth/login renders a working \"Sign in with Microsoft\" button that round-trips through the External tenant's hosted sign-in page ({tenant}.ciamlogin.com). Replaces the no-op IExternalLoginFlow shipped by VisuAuth.EntraCore with a real implementation that reads the OIDC-authenticated principal, verifies the user against Microsoft Graph, and returns the success outcome the existing End-user UI expects. Consumers who only need admin CRUD (no End-user sign-in) skip this package and pay nothing.",
